Subject: [PATCH] editor GPU erosion: no HLSL intrinsic names (dst, noise) as
 identifiers in the kernels

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F37er45a7etRuMgEW1q3kY

